      "prompt": "Write a self-contained technical note in exactly five numbered sections about designing a local text-generation service. Cover, in order: model identity, resource admission, streaming, cancellation, and shutdown. Each section must state one invariant, one failure mode, and one concrete verification. Do not use a table.",
